---
layout: listing.njk
title: Adventures
description: Recaps and photos from Disco Carrot events at ski resorts across the West.
permalink: /adventures/
---

<div class="listing-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">On the Mountain</p>
  <h1>Adventures</h1>
  <p>Recaps and photos from our past events</p>
  <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dctaixj2i/image/upload/v1775672651/Mikah_fans_jy0ijm.jpg" style="margin: 32px auto 48px; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 2px; display: block;"/>
  <p class="eyebrow">You Were There. Show Us What You Saw.</p>
  <p>Got some sick photos or videos? We wanna to see 'em! Drop your best shots and we might feature them.</p>
  <a href="https://mega.nz/filerequest/XZUvpqiU7nY" target="_blank" class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 16px;">Upload Media →</a>
</div>

<div class="listing-grid">
  {%- for post in collections.adventures -%}
  <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="listing-card">
    {% if post.data.thumbnail %}
    <img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">
    {% endif %}
    <div class="listing-card-body">
      <div class="listing-card-date">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      <span class="read-more">Read More →</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>
